OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with light winds, variable
OL,7,Fcloud and clear spells. Mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches are likely to develop in any
OL,9,Fprolonged clear periods, particularly
OL,10,Fin the west. Chilly, but temperatures
OL,11,Faround average for the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAreas of mist and fog will
OL,14,Fslowly lift and clear through the
OL,15,Fmorning, giving way to sunny spells.
OL,16,FWinds light throughout. Fog will
OL,17,Fredevelop overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
