OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FPotentially a foggy start with cloud
OL,7,Fand patchy rain later for Sunday. Fine
OL,8,Fand dry on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average. Turning
OL,10,Fbreezy at times.
